This repository contains components under different licenses. No single license applies to every file.

## License map

- `patches/0001-*.patch` and `patches/0002-*.patch` modify the upstream i915 file `drivers/gpu/drm/i915/gem/i915_gem_pages.c`, whose SPDX identifier is MIT in both Linux v6.12 and FreeBSD drm-kmod's drm_v6.12.85 branch. The upstream source retains its MIT terms and copyright notices. The project-authored additions in these patch files are licensed under BSD-2-Clause. See [LICENSES/MIT.txt](LICENSES/MIT.txt) and [LICENSES/BSD-2-Clause.txt](LICENSES/BSD-2-Clause.txt).
- `tests/*` (standalone reproducer, runner, and Makefile): BSD-2-Clause for project-authored portions.
- `README.md`, `docs/*`, and `patches/README.md`: BSD-2-Clause for project-authored documentation.

The FreeBSD source tree contains files under multiple licenses; BSD-2-Clause is a common license used in the project, not a single blanket license for every FreeBSD or drm-kmod file. This repository does not relicense upstream Linux/FreeBSD DRM source code. Preserve all upstream copyright and license notices when applying or redistributing the patch.
